  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Counterpoint's goal:\n\n- A) Independent coherent melodic lines combined\n- B) Unison always\n- C) No dissonance ever\n- D) Percussion only\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Contrary motion: one ascends, other descends.\n\n**Answer:** True",
